WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:32.700 --> 00:01:34.240
[KAIDO]
Ah, I get it now.

3
00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:40.500
You're gonna turn into your Sulong form
and go berserk once you gaze at the moon.

4
00:01:45.170 --> 00:01:47.550
<b>I Can't Imagine Losing</b>

5
00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:54.720
It's Jack!

6
00:01:54.820 --> 00:01:58.280
[CAT VIPER growls]

7
00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:05.130
[JACK]
You put together a hell of a plan,
didn't you? But that doesn't mean you're

8
00:02:05.150 --> 00:02:09.110
strong enough to win.
Just that we were careless.

9
00:02:09.110 --> 00:02:14.910
You won't lay another finger on Kaido! I'm
about to dye this snow red with your blood!

10
00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:18.200
[BEAST PIRATES yell]

11
00:02:18.200 --> 00:02:20.370
[CAT VIPER]
Hold your swords. One moment.

12
00:02:21.290 --> 00:02:27.500
[ALL]
Huh? Jack devastated our thousand-year-old kingdom
and tormented our people. That man is our sworn enemy.

13
00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:31.340
We turned him away countless times,
but he would not relent.

14
00:02:31.340 --> 00:02:35.300
The warrior you were searching
for is right here! It is I!

15
00:02:36.640 --> 00:02:37.930
[JACK]
Raizo.

16
00:02:38.300 --> 00:02:40.060
I owe the Minks my life!

17
00:02:40.060 --> 00:02:43.890
Every cruelty you committed
shall be punished with the force of my fury!

18
00:02:57.660 --> 00:02:59.410
Please, allow us.

19
00:02:59.410 --> 00:03:01.580
Save your power for Kaido.

20
00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:07.320
[SHISHILIAN]
You-gara as well.

21
00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:20.220
Alright. Then best of luck.

22
00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:22.220
I'm grateful.

23
00:03:22.220 --> 00:03:26.940
I promise you-gara that
I will show Kaido every ounce of my strength.

24
00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:05.890
<b>Roddy & BB
Whale Forest Guardians</b>

25
00:04:19.530 --> 00:04:22.990
<b>Giovanni, Shishilian, & Concelot
Inuarashi's Three Musketeers</b>

26
00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:37.590
[JACK]
Don't worry, they

27
00:04:37.590 --> 00:04:39.800
can't maintain that form for long.

28
00:04:39.800 --> 00:04:41.470
Yeah, bring it on!

29
00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.430
We're beasts, too, you know!

30
00:04:43.430 --> 00:04:46.390
<b>Nangi of the Numbers</b>

31
00:05:07.500 --> 00:05:09.460
They must have started fighting.

32
00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:13.540
You think that rat bastard Jack went
outside with them, too?

33
00:05:13.540 --> 00:05:16.590
[KING]
Unlike you,
he's considerate enough to leave.

34
00:05:18.170 --> 00:05:25.430
Huh? Excuse me? What was that?
If you've got a problem with me, just say so, Punkass.

35
00:05:25.720 --> 00:05:27.600
[MOMONOSUKE]
Shinobu?

36
00:05:28.810 --> 00:05:32.160
Ripe-Ripe Enticement Jutsu!

37
00:05:39.900 --> 00:05:40.860
Steady now.

38
00:05:52.620 --> 00:05:53.790
[SHINOBU]
No!

39
00:06:02.260 --> 00:06:04.590
– Oh no!
– Your plan was solid in theory.

40
00:06:04.590 --> 00:06:05.970
But the execution was

41
00:06:05.970 --> 00:06:08.690
lacking, to say the least.

42
00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.320
Shinobu!

43
00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:30.420
Shinobu! Oh no!

44
00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:36.000
Shinobu!

45
00:06:36.000 --> 00:06:38.200
[SHINOBU gasps]
Lord Momonosuke!

46
00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:43.550
I passed out for a moment. How shameful.

47
00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.800
Now, away!

48
00:06:55.520 --> 00:06:56.560
Wait, what?

49
00:06:58.190 --> 00:07:00.570
[QUEEN gasps]
How the hell is he flying?

50
00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:02.490
And why is he so bad at it?

51
00:07:02.490 --> 00:07:08.670
[MOMONOSUKE gasping]

52
00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:09.990
[MOMONOSUKE]
I'm too high up!

53
00:07:09.990 --> 00:07:12.450
It's scary!

54
00:07:15.410 --> 00:07:17.120
He's floating through the air!

55
00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:18.670
What sorcery is this?

56
00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.550
[KING]
On behalf of the commander,

57
00:07:26.550 --> 00:07:28.220
I shall execute you!

58
00:07:46.280 --> 00:07:48.200
I can't see a damn thing!

59
00:07:48.200 --> 00:07:49.410
How's he doing that?

60
00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:02.380
[MOMONOSUKE]
Sangoro!

61
00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:03.750
Just in time!

62
00:08:03.750 --> 00:08:05.630
It's Sanji!

63
00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:06.920
Let's go!

64
00:08:10.930 --> 00:08:16.990
[KING]
Hand over the boy. He and the Kozuki name
must be erased from this world once and for all.

65
00:08:34.830 --> 00:08:36.290
Don't worry! I've got you, my lord!

66
00:08:42.040 --> 00:08:43.380
[SANJI]
Hey, Momo!

67
00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:46.670
Nice speech earlier!

68
00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.880
You were badass.

69
00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:50.590
Sangoro!

70
00:08:51.260 --> 00:08:53.220
Hear me now!

71
00:08:53.220 --> 00:08:59.980
I shall become the Shogun
of the Land of Wano!

72
00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:04.150
I did my best!

73
00:09:06.560 --> 00:09:09.280
[SANJI]
Alright, Shinobu! Keep him safe!

74
00:09:09.280 --> 00:09:10.610
Understood!

75
00:09:11.320 --> 00:09:13.780
Sangoro, I shall repay you!

76
00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:17.530
[SAMURAI C]
Look!
Lord Momonosuke's been saved!

77
00:09:18.750 --> 00:09:20.540
[KING]
You're not going anywhere.

78
00:09:20.540 --> 00:09:22.370
[SANJI]
Acceleration device!

79
00:09:36.850 --> 00:09:37.890
[SANJI]
Stealth mode!

80
00:09:53.740 --> 00:09:57.870
[SANJI]
Shooting Star! Soba Kick!

81
00:10:57.470 --> 00:11:00.470
[SANJI]
Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold up, my guy!

82
00:11:00.470 --> 00:11:02.180
I can't be on the losing end

83
00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:03.600
here! Knock it off!

84
00:11:07.690 --> 00:11:09.690
[SANJI]
Damn it, you bird bastard!

85
00:11:11.110 --> 00:11:14.900
[SANJI]
You're gonna leave a gigantic hole
in my torso if you keep this up!

86
00:11:15.360 --> 00:11:18.200
[KING]
More than just that, I'll rip you in two!

87
00:11:18.910 --> 00:11:21.370
If you're so scared,
why don't you disappear again?

88
00:11:22.540 --> 00:11:25.210
[SANJI]
This might be hard
for your bird brain to comprehend,

89
00:11:25.390 --> 00:11:27.830
but it's just a trick. Lemme go, damn it!

90
00:11:27.830 --> 00:11:29.290
[KING]
Say goodbye.

91
00:11:34.260 --> 00:11:36.220
Sanji, no!

92
00:11:41.760 --> 00:11:45.770
That attack was crazy.
I think Sanji needs my help.

93
00:11:45.770 --> 00:11:48.310
Hey, Yomato! Be back in a sec!

94
00:11:48.310 --> 00:11:50.190
Keep an eye on Momo for me!

95
00:11:50.190 --> 00:11:51.360
Is that okay?

96
00:11:51.730 --> 00:11:53.480
Why wouldn't it be okay?

97
00:11:53.480 --> 00:11:56.450
Uh, right! You have a point!

98
00:11:56.450 --> 00:11:58.910
He– He is my son after all!

99
00:11:58.920 --> 00:12:01.330
[ULTI grunts]

100
00:12:01.330 --> 00:12:02.700
Then hurry it up!

101
00:12:02.700 --> 00:12:04.750
Yeah. Leave it to me.

102
00:12:04.750 --> 00:12:07.960
That boy will be protected
because that's what good parents do!

103
00:12:07.960 --> 00:12:09.580
[ULTI]
Hey! I'm not done with you!

104
00:12:09.580 --> 00:12:11.420
[YAMATO]
Wait for me, Momonosuke!

105
00:12:11.420 --> 00:12:14.460
Your father is on his way!

106
00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:14.460
[ULTI]
Wait! Stop running away from me!

107
00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.050
[BIG MOM]
Not so fast, you!

108
00:12:21.180 --> 00:12:23.890
Come on out and help Mama!

109
00:12:23.890 --> 00:12:28.480
The sooner we get rid of these samurai,
the sooner the feast can begin!

110
00:12:28.480 --> 00:12:30.980
You guys want that, don't you?

111
00:12:31.000 --> 00:12:35.620
[BEAST PIRATES cheer]

112
00:12:35.650 --> 00:12:37.320
It's time to pay!

113
00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:41.870
Remember the wedding?
The tea party? And now this banquet!

114
00:12:41.870 --> 00:12:46.160
You've managed to destroy everything
I've looked forward to!

115
00:12:46.160 --> 00:12:51.750
[BIG MOM]
I am going
to destroy you in a spectacular fashion!

116
00:12:52.380 --> 00:12:57.430
You will die like the worm you are!

117
00:12:59.050 --> 00:13:01.510
Ikoku!

118
00:13:22.240 --> 00:13:24.200
[SASAKI]
What the hell was that?

119
00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:36.130
That crone is too powerful for her own good.

120
00:13:36.130 --> 00:13:42.470
From the stories I've heard, she's not someone we should take
lightly. She's a pirate captain every bit as fearsome as Kaido!

121
00:13:42.470 --> 00:13:47.600
Seriously? But if we can't handle one guy,
how are we supposed to handle two of 'em, huh?

122
00:13:47.600 --> 00:13:53.500
C'mon! I need to ditch her so I can help
Momo and Sanji! If I go to them, she'll follow,

123
00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.320
and the last thing I wanna
do is put them in more danger.

124
00:13:56.320 --> 00:13:58.820
[BIG MOM]
Goodness, you're rather slippery,

125
00:13:58.820 --> 00:14:02.400
aren't you? You scurried right out of the way.

126
00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:03.740
Oh, Zeus?

127
00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:07.220
[BIG MOM]
Hmm? Hm?

128
00:14:09.790 --> 00:14:11.910
Hey, Zeus! Where are you?

129
00:14:13.000 --> 00:14:14.040
[gasps]
Get back here!

130
00:14:14.040 --> 00:14:14.880
It's time to go!

131
00:14:14.880 --> 00:14:17.710
C'mon, please, Nami, what are you are doing?

132
00:14:17.710 --> 00:14:20.050
You've seen first-hand how mad Mama
can get! She's gonna murder us!

133
00:14:20.550 --> 00:14:22.220
I'll have to punish you.

134
00:14:22.270 --> 00:14:24.090
[gasps]

135
00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:27.430
Now, let's get this thing over with!

136
00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:30.020
[gasps]
Yes, Mama...

137
00:14:30.020 --> 00:14:31.350
[NAMI]
Hey!

138
00:14:31.350 --> 00:14:33.230
You wanna escape with your life

139
00:14:33.230 --> 00:14:34.900
or have Big Mom kill you?

140
00:14:35.250 --> 00:14:38.110
Huh? But I can't go against Big Mom!

141
00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:40.780
That is enough!

142
00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:53.370
[BIG MOM]
Give him back,
you little cat burglar!

143
00:14:57.420 --> 00:15:00.050
Please find it in your heart to forgive me!

144
00:15:00.050 --> 00:15:01.920
It's all my fault.

145
00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:07.220
I really messed up, Mama!
I should have never disobeyed you!

146
00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:11.300
[BIG MOM]
Honey, it's
all right. Come back home.

147
00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:18.610
You can make it up to me by taking out this little tramp!
It's the only way you can earn my trust!

148
00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:22.320
[ZEUS gasps]
I will do anything
for you! Just say it!

149
00:15:22.320 --> 00:15:25.240
You want me to cut ties with her?
It's a done deal!

150
00:15:25.740 --> 00:15:27.740
[BIG MOM]
That's what I like to hear.

151
00:15:28.280 --> 00:15:31.370
Now, go and make your Mama proud!

152
00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:35.960
♪ The time?

153
00:15:35.960 --> 00:15:38.710
It's flown away. ♪

154
00:15:38.710 --> 00:15:41.630
♪ I'm like the wind. ♪

155
00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:47.220
You've only got one chance to make this right!

156
00:15:47.220 --> 00:15:49.640
If you screw this up, you're done for!

157
00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:51.310
[ZEUS cries]

158
00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:52.600
No!

159
00:15:52.600 --> 00:15:55.350
Soul Sensor Activate!

160
00:15:59.270 --> 00:16:02.110
I am really sorry, Nami!

161
00:16:02.110 --> 00:16:04.740
Been nice knowing you and all!

162
00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:07.070
You pathetic little coward!

163
00:16:07.070 --> 00:16:09.110
I am so over you!

164
00:16:09.160 --> 00:16:12.080
[cackles]

165
00:16:12.080 --> 00:16:15.120
Somebody help me!

166
00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.290
My brother,

167
00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:18.460
I'm by his side.

168
00:16:18.460 --> 00:16:20.330
Like a bird, we will fly.

169
00:16:20.750 --> 00:16:26.260
Say goodbye. Soaring so high.

170
00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:32.140
♪ you'll hear our cry!
♪ ♪ I'm a tough guy! ♪

171
00:16:33.430 --> 00:16:40.270
Born to be free. Go, go, Franky.

172
00:16:53.660 --> 00:16:55.450
[BROOK]
Rain, rain go away.

173
00:17:06.590 --> 00:17:10.260
[FRANKY]
Whoops! I think
I hit something back there.

174
00:17:13.640 --> 00:17:15.060
No biggie.

175
00:17:15.850 --> 00:17:18.180
As long as it wasn't a pretty flower.

176
00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:23.650
Thanks, Big Bro!

177
00:17:26.780 --> 00:17:27.730
[NAPOLEON]
Mama!

178
00:17:28.030 --> 00:17:29.030
Wake up!

179
00:17:29.400 --> 00:17:31.530
[BEAST PIRATE A]
They're doomed!

180
00:17:31.530 --> 00:17:34.160
[gasps]
This is about to get ugly, real fast!

181
00:17:36.490 --> 00:17:40.210
[BEAST PIRATE B]
He hit her straight
in the face! She's gonna flip out!

182
00:17:44.380 --> 00:17:46.420
[giggles]
Big bro!

183
00:17:49.420 --> 00:17:51.380
Thank you! You're the best!

184
00:17:51.840 --> 00:17:53.050
Hey, are you-teia okay?

185
00:17:53.680 --> 00:17:54.760
That was crazy!

186
00:17:54.760 --> 00:17:56.640
Yeah, it was crazy awesome!

187
00:17:57.180 --> 00:17:59.560
Franky's here! We got this under control!

188
00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.020
[giggles]

189
00:18:01.180 --> 00:18:03.060
Forward! Show 'em what you've got!

190
00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.320
[FRANKY]
Guess we missed the kickoff.

191
00:18:11.860 --> 00:18:13.740
Oh, boy.

192
00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:16.120
That was quite the entrance they made,

193
00:18:16.120 --> 00:18:18.870
but I have a plan. Can you help out?

194
00:18:18.870 --> 00:18:21.000
Of course! This should be fun.

195
00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.040
Wow, nice.

196
00:18:24.040 --> 00:18:26.250
It looks like they've got
things covered for now.

197
00:18:26.250 --> 00:18:28.590
Alright, up I go.

198
00:18:29.250 --> 00:18:31.170
Time to help Kin'emon!

199
00:18:31.510 --> 00:18:32.630
I'm ready!

200
00:18:37.550 --> 00:18:38.600
[gasps]
There you are!

201
00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:42.230
I'm so glad I found you!

202
00:18:42.230 --> 00:18:44.350
Kozuki Momonosuke!

203
00:18:44.520 --> 00:18:47.110
[gasps]

204
00:18:47.190 --> 00:18:48.150
And who are you?

205
00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:57.410
[LUFFY]
Hey, Shinobu!

206
00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:00.790
Don't worry, he's our friend.

207
00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:02.290
He's gonna help you guys out.

208
00:19:02.290 --> 00:19:04.580
Huh? An ally?

209
00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.960
[gasps]

210
00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.590
[YAMATO]
Mm! It's safer to be with him
than to be by yourselves.

211
00:19:13.130 --> 00:19:14.260
See ya!

212
00:19:17.930 --> 00:19:19.850
[SHINOBU]
You're a friend of Sir Luffy?

213
00:19:19.850 --> 00:19:21.060
I am!

214
00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.310
Well, good.

215
00:19:26.310 --> 00:19:27.520
Then I'll trust you.

216
00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:29.400
[MOMONOSUKE]
What is your name?

217
00:19:29.400 --> 00:19:31.170
[giggles]

218
00:19:31.220 --> 00:19:33.280
[BOTH gasp]

219
00:19:33.280 --> 00:19:34.440
Glad you asked!

220
00:19:39.700 --> 00:19:42.200
My name is Kozuki Oden!

221
00:19:44.830 --> 00:19:46.830
And I shall protect you!

222
00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.500
You're my father?

223
00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:54.380
Lord Oden?

224
00:20:01.010 --> 00:20:03.220
[gasps]
Hold on.

225
00:20:04.100 --> 00:20:05.060
You have breasts.

226
00:20:05.560 --> 00:20:06.940
And horns!

227
00:20:06.940 --> 00:20:09.860
Why, you're not my father at all!

228
00:20:09.860 --> 00:20:13.190
This is highly suspicious!
You must be our foe!

229
00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:14.320
What?

230
00:20:16.490 --> 00:20:18.280
[SHINOBU]
Smoke Escape Jutsu!

231
00:20:18.280 --> 00:20:19.320
[YAMATO]
Wait!

232
00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.120
Why are you running away?

233
00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:36.340
[HYOGORO panting]
There's
too many of them.

234
00:20:36.340 --> 00:20:38.180
We just keep getting bogged down.

235
00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.840
Yes, you're right.

236
00:20:39.840 --> 00:20:44.010
There's no point in fighting these small fries.
We need a change of plans.

237
00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:48.520
What about the Tobi Roppo?
Those dinosaur people that Denjiro mentioned?

238
00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:50.900
Might turn the tide
if we could kill some of them.

239
00:20:51.190 --> 00:20:53.360
Maybe that's a bit optimistic...

240
00:20:54.320 --> 00:20:57.780
But even if we can't win,
we can still stall them!

241
00:20:59.200 --> 00:21:04.410
Oh, you brutes! It takes
some nerve to run me over!

242
00:21:04.410 --> 00:21:06.580
[BEAST PIRATE D]
Big Mom
is about to go berserk!

243
00:21:21.840 --> 00:21:25.600
Look at all the Straw Hats ling up.

244
00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:29.730
Are you ready to get crushed?

245
00:21:33.150 --> 00:21:36.610
Hello, Soul King! It's been quite a while.

246
00:21:37.400 --> 00:21:42.570
If nothing else, I applaud your captain
for gathering so many unique creatures.

247
00:21:44.450 --> 00:21:45.910
Yoho! I see you're a woman of taste!

248
00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:50.790
Huh. Yeah? You like
my iron body, old hag? Alright.

249
00:21:51.710 --> 00:21:54.940
Then I'll give you a demonstration!

250
00:21:57.710 --> 00:21:59.630
Cyborg power.

251
00:22:06.100 --> 00:22:08.430
[FRANKY]
I'm one of a kind, baby!

252
00:22:08.720 --> 00:22:10.600
Franky, stop! Are you crazy?

253
00:22:11.060 --> 00:22:13.230
She's an Emperor! We gotta run!

254
00:22:14.310 --> 00:22:15.730
Is that so?

255
00:22:17.150 --> 00:22:19.030
Do we run from Emperors?

256
00:22:21.030 --> 00:22:22.780
I dunno.

257
00:22:22.780 --> 00:22:23.910
Guess we could,

258
00:22:25.070 --> 00:22:26.780
but what about our captain?

259
00:22:29.540 --> 00:22:34.670
[FRANKY]
You want him to become
King of the Pirates. Don't you, Nami?

260
00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:49.560
...Radical...

261
00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:54.730
Yikes!

262
00:22:54.730 --> 00:22:58.120
They're huge! What in the world are they?

263
00:23:01.650 --> 00:23:02.990
[BEAST PIRATE E]
Hey, buzz off!

264
00:23:02.990 --> 00:23:06.200
If you're gonna go wild, stay
in your own banquet hall!

265
00:23:07.700 --> 00:23:09.410
Stupid Numbers!

266
00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:17.500
No!

267
00:23:17.500 --> 00:23:19.670
They're as big as Oars!

268
00:23:19.670 --> 00:23:21.130
They're monsters!

269
00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:25.510
I'm getting mad flashbacks from Thriller Bark.

270
00:23:25.610 --> 00:23:29.100
[BIG MOM cackles]

271
00:23:29.100 --> 00:23:35.020
Fancy that! Those must be Caesar's failed attempts
at recreating ancient Giants.

272
00:23:35.020 --> 00:23:38.760
No use to me, but it would seem
that Kaido uses them!

273
00:23:39.360 --> 00:23:41.320
How lovely.

274
00:23:43.610 --> 00:23:46.070
[gasps]
Is he grabbing
what I think he's grabbing?

275
00:23:46.780 --> 00:23:48.620
The Brachio Tank!

276
00:23:48.620 --> 00:23:50.370
Usopp and Chopper are in there!

277
00:23:50.370 --> 00:23:56.290
Hey, monster face!
Put that down or I'm gonna make you!

278
00:24:24.530 --> 00:24:27.280
Now that my lasers are upgraded,

279
00:24:27.280 --> 00:24:29.070
I'm unstoppable.

280
00:24:30.570 --> 00:24:33.660
Ah, you should've saved that attack for me.

281
00:24:34.660 --> 00:24:38.630
It's too late now, iron man.

282
00:24:41.790 --> 00:24:43.500
[JIMBEI]
Your hand, madam.

283
00:24:44.340 --> 00:24:46.670
Fishman Jiu-Jitsu!

284
00:24:47.130 --> 00:24:48.510
Mil Fleurs!

285
00:24:54.060 --> 00:24:59.440
Whirlpool Shoulder Throw!

286
00:25:03.770 --> 00:25:05.400
And Delphinium!

287
00:25:07.940 --> 00:25:10.910
[BIG MOM]
Curse you, Jimbei!

288
00:25:10.910 --> 00:25:13.030
I haven't forgotten what you did to my fleet!

289
00:25:13.490 --> 00:25:18.480
I'll kill you, too, soon enough!

290
00:25:20.790 --> 00:25:22.920
Ha. Good luck.

291
00:25:22.920 --> 00:25:26.450
[BIG MOM gasping]

292
00:25:29.380 --> 00:25:30.550
Nice plan!

293
00:25:33.800 --> 00:25:35.810
[laughs]
Went better than expected!

294
00:25:35.810 --> 00:25:38.270
She'll be even angrier when she gets back.

295
00:25:38.430 --> 00:25:40.410
[ROBIN laughs]

296
00:25:40.520 --> 00:25:43.310
You are quite a remarkable woman.

297
00:25:43.310 --> 00:25:45.070
Good job!

298
00:25:45.070 --> 00:25:48.400
Thanks for the assist!
I coulda been scrap metal!

299
00:25:49.940 --> 00:25:51.780
[JIMBEI laughs]
Then I'm glad
we made it in time!

300
00:25:52.450 --> 00:25:54.160
And now...

301
00:25:58.700 --> 00:26:01.210
[FRANKY]
The moment
you've all been waiting for.

302
00:26:10.550 --> 00:26:13.800
[FRANKY]
Commander Chopper!
Got a status report for me?

303
00:26:16.180 --> 00:26:17.310
[gasps]
Usopp! Wake up!

304
00:26:17.310 --> 00:26:19.430
Usopp! Pull it together!

305
00:26:19.430 --> 00:26:21.730
We're getting a call from Franky! C'mon!

306
00:26:22.100 --> 00:26:24.480
[FRANKY]
Hey! What's gives?
You good in there?

307
00:26:26.480 --> 00:26:30.990
Uh... Yep, couldn't fell better, thanks
to the Brachio Tank.

308
00:26:32.280 --> 00:26:34.320
You remember our promise, right?

309
00:26:35.870 --> 00:26:37.950
"Our promise"?

310
00:26:38.280 --> 00:26:40.370
We were gonna combine!

311
00:26:40.370 --> 00:26:43.120
The Iron Pirate, bro!

312
00:26:43.120 --> 00:26:45.080
Docking time, baby!

313
00:26:45.420 --> 00:26:46.790
Iron.

314
00:26:46.790 --> 00:26:48.460
...Pirate?

315
00:26:53.880 --> 00:26:57.600
– Finally.
– Finally.

316
00:26:59.890 --> 00:27:01.980
[LUFFY]
Good. I can see the sky.

317
00:27:02.350 --> 00:27:05.100
Okay. I think I can make it up from here.

318
00:27:07.150 --> 00:27:08.230
[BEAST PIRATE F]
Not so fast!

319
00:27:09.020 --> 00:27:10.400
Uh, Master Queen!

320
00:27:10.400 --> 00:27:12.780
Go away, I'm taking a break.

321
00:27:12.780 --> 00:27:14.430
But it's Straw Hat!

322
00:27:15.610 --> 00:27:17.870
Huh? What?! He's here?!

323
00:27:19.330 --> 00:27:21.120
And who the hell is that?!

324
00:27:21.620 --> 00:27:23.500
[LUFFY]
Hey there, Zoro!

325
00:27:23.500 --> 00:27:25.000
[ZORO]
Well, look who it is.

326
00:27:25.000 --> 00:27:26.330
Where are you headed?

327
00:27:26.330 --> 00:27:28.040
Up to fight Kaido!

328
00:27:29.000 --> 00:27:30.340
I'm coming with you.

329
00:27:30.340 --> 00:27:32.210
You're not getting away!

330
00:27:41.100 --> 00:27:43.390
[ZORO gasps]
What
the hell is that thing? It's huge!

331
00:27:44.980 --> 00:27:46.020
Ready?

332
00:27:48.650 --> 00:27:51.270
[LUFFY]
Gum-Gum

333
00:27:51.270 --> 00:27:53.820
Rocket!

334
00:27:55.240 --> 00:27:56.610
Good! We got this.

335
00:27:56.990 --> 00:27:58.450
You said Kaido's up there?

336
00:27:58.450 --> 00:28:01.950
Yeah. I think he started fighting
with Kin'emon's group already!

337
00:28:01.950 --> 00:28:03.910
Just a little more!

338
00:28:11.790 --> 00:28:14.010
Damn!

339
00:28:14.010 --> 00:28:17.340
[QUEEN]
You ain't goin'
nowhere on my watch.

340
00:28:20.180 --> 00:28:22.640
[KING]
Give up. I control these skies!

341
00:28:26.520 --> 00:28:28.770
[ZORO groans]
We're never gonna make it
with these bastards hounding us!

342
00:28:28.770 --> 00:28:31.190
[gasps]
I didn't think
they'd be guarding the roof!

343
00:28:54.420 --> 00:28:56.970
Yeah. That's what I'm talkin' about!

344
00:28:56.970 --> 00:28:59.470
Let's do it!

345
00:29:01.140 --> 00:29:04.180
[BOTH gasp]
– Docking formation! Ready to combine!
– Docking formation! Ready to combine!

346
00:29:12.730 --> 00:29:14.070
[FRANKY]
Black Rhino, standing by!

347
00:29:16.530 --> 00:29:19.950
[BOTH]
Brachio Head, activate! Let's do this!

348
00:29:19.950 --> 00:29:21.940
[BOTH scream]

349
00:29:22.120 --> 00:29:24.740
[FRANKY]
Sorry, bros, it's only got one seat!

350
00:29:24.740 --> 00:29:26.240
[BOTH]
– What?!
– What?!

351
00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:28.710
[USOPP]
This is a betrayal!

352
00:29:28.710 --> 00:29:30.370
Who's that up there?

353
00:29:30.370 --> 00:29:32.790
[SAMURAI B]
It's Usohachi!
And Choppereamon!

354
00:29:33.210 --> 00:29:34.710
Are you two alright?

355
00:29:34.710 --> 00:29:39.720
Back at the Pleasure Hall, you guys really
stuck your necks out for us! We really owe you one!

356
00:29:39.720 --> 00:29:42.640
Yeah, sure! But you can thank us later!

357
00:29:42.640 --> 00:29:44.010
Yeah, later!

358
00:29:44.010 --> 00:29:46.970
Right now, there's a robot that you gotta see!

359
00:30:03.160 --> 00:30:05.780
[FRANKY]
Iron Pirate!

360
00:30:06.530 --> 00:30:09.620
General Franky!

361
00:30:13.830 --> 00:30:15.420
[FRANKY]
Let's rock!

362
00:30:16.540 --> 00:30:18.460
Franky Cannon!

363
00:30:20.260 --> 00:30:22.380
Then why do you have a giant robot?

364
00:30:22.380 --> 00:30:23.380
C'mon!

365
00:30:31.230 --> 00:30:33.190
He took out Jaki fast!

366
00:30:33.190 --> 00:30:35.060
That thing is bad news!

367
00:30:35.060 --> 00:30:37.690
Let's move! We'll just get stomped!

368
00:30:37.690 --> 00:30:38.820
[BEAST PIRATE K]
Uh, yeah!

369
00:30:44.200 --> 00:30:45.070
[SANJI]
Momo...

370
00:30:46.620 --> 00:30:48.410
[SANJI]
I hope he got away.

371
00:30:48.410 --> 00:30:50.790
[SANJI]
Hate to say it, but this suit is tough.

372
00:30:54.420 --> 00:30:56.040
[HYOGORO laughs]
Oh, sorry.

373
00:30:56.040 --> 00:30:59.750
This just tickles
my funny bone. Look around us!

374
00:31:00.300 --> 00:31:03.660
We're outnumbered, enemies on every side.

375
00:31:03.760 --> 00:31:06.140
And yet, for some reason,

376
00:31:06.140 --> 00:31:08.390
I feel like we can't be beat.

377
00:31:08.390 --> 00:31:09.640
You're damn right!

378
00:31:09.640 --> 00:31:11.270
I thought the same thing.

379
00:31:11.270 --> 00:31:14.520
I wonder why? Where
does this courage come from?

380
00:31:14.520 --> 00:31:16.520
When you put it that way

381
00:31:16.520 --> 00:31:19.610
I suppose we have Mister Straw Hat
to thank, don't we?

382
00:31:22.900 --> 00:31:25.780
Looks like I won't be able
to jump up there after all.

383
00:31:25.780 --> 00:31:27.660
I guess, I need a new plan.

384
00:31:28.320 --> 00:31:29.580
I've got your back, Captain.

385
00:31:30.830 --> 00:31:32.620
You've got me. Let's head up.

386
00:31:35.500 --> 00:31:37.710
This is a damn pain.

387
00:31:37.710 --> 00:31:40.710
Bastards were ready. They got
the whole swarm up there!

388
00:31:41.130 --> 00:31:44.420
They'll be nothing but caterpillars
once we tear off their wings.

389
00:31:44.420 --> 00:31:47.550
[USOPP]
I get the sentiment,
but do you have to be so creepy about it?

390
00:31:49.600 --> 00:31:53.560
[BROOK laughs]
I suppose those dinosaurs
are the fabled "Lead Performers"?

391
00:31:53.560 --> 00:31:57.400
[CHOPPER grunts]

392
00:31:57.400 --> 00:32:01.860
They look pretty tough, but I'm not worried
'cuz our captain's stronger!

393
00:32:01.860 --> 00:32:03.150
[NAMI]
That's right.

394
00:32:03.150 --> 00:32:07.610
And as navigator, it's my duty to help
him get wherever he needs to go!

395
00:32:11.280 --> 00:32:13.580
[FRANKY]
Don't sweat a thing, brother.

396
00:32:13.580 --> 00:32:16.910
General Franky's gonna clear out those thugs
before you can say "super"!

397
00:32:19.710 --> 00:32:21.540
Everyone's ready, Captain!

398
00:32:24.300 --> 00:32:28.020
Right! Time for round two! Let's do it!

399
00:32:28.180 --> 00:32:31.350
Samurai! Don't give 'em an inch!

400
00:32:31.350 --> 00:32:33.100
We're counting on you!

401
00:32:48.360 --> 00:32:50.770
You better get ready, Kaido.

402
00:32:50.770 --> 00:32:53.410
'Cause I'm coming for ya.
